    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ddb9edb8f06668b8c2d52aa26a5ff9d3.poster.avif?t=1754324124\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ddb9edb8f06668b8c2d52aa26a5ff9d3.webm?t=1754324124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ddb9edb8f06668b8c2d52aa26a5ff9d3.mp4?t=1754324124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go North</strong> is the first immersive maze adventure ever. With the help of numerous magical and technological items, navigate beautifully unique mazes and explore expansive worlds in a story-driven adventure like no other.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ef6e185d2b3b6606563e096233ebd87b.poster.avif?t=1754324124\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ef6e185d2b3b6606563e096233ebd87b.webm?t=1754324124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ef6e185d2b3b6606563e096233ebd87b.mp4?t=1754324124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said that the Maze God resides at the northernmost part of the world and that he grants one wish to any adventurer brave and clever enough to reach him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dara begins her journey with a singular purpose: to Go North, meet the Maze God and have her undying wish granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/4cb2c7db155cee69f94b8c772a1490ec.poster.avif?t=1754324124\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/4cb2c7db155cee69f94b8c772a1490ec.webm?t=1754324124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/4cb2c7db155cee69f94b8c772a1490ec.mp4?t=1754324124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She must navigate countless mazes and labyrinths purposefully crafted by the Maze Makers to test her perseverance. But something sinister seems to be corrupting the mazes. Something\u2026 or someone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate beautiful mazes in 3rd person: walk around atmospheric and gorgeous mazes while discovering different items, characters, puzzles and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, keep and use unique and helpful items scattered around each maze ranging from simple items like a hoverboard to more elaborate items like a robot mouse that scurries towards the exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and avoid obstacles: use your wits to solve the different puzzles and obstacles within each maze. decipher different riddles and clues to uncover secret passages, items and easter eggs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer:\u00a0compete online against your friends and players across the globe, cross-platform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade:\u00a0explore an infinite amount of cleverly generated mazes of varying forms and worlds. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ddb9edb8f06668b8c2d52aa26a5ff9d3.poster.avif?t=1754324124\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ddb9edb8f06668b8c2d52aa26a5ff9d3.webm?t=1754324124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ddb9edb8f06668b8c2d52aa26a5ff9d3.mp4?t=1754324124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go North</strong> is the first immersive maze adventure ever. With the help of numerous magical and technological items, navigate beautifully unique mazes and explore expansive worlds in a story-driven adventure like no other.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ef6e185d2b3b6606563e096233ebd87b.poster.avif?t=1754324124\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ef6e185d2b3b6606563e096233ebd87b.webm?t=1754324124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ef6e185d2b3b6606563e096233ebd87b.mp4?t=1754324124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said that the Maze God resides at the northernmost part of the world and that he grants one wish to any adventurer brave and clever enough to reach him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dara begins her journey with a singular purpose: to Go North, meet the Maze God and have her undying wish granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/4cb2c7db155cee69f94b8c772a1490ec.poster.avif?t=1754324124\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/4cb2c7db155cee69f94b8c772a1490ec.webm?t=1754324124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/4cb2c7db155cee69f94b8c772a1490ec.mp4?t=1754324124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She must navigate countless mazes and labyrinths purposefully crafted by the Maze Makers to test her perseverance. But something sinister seems to be corrupting the mazes. Something\u2026 or someone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate beautiful mazes in 3rd person: walk around atmospheric and gorgeous mazes while discovering different items, characters, puzzles and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, keep and use unique and helpful items scattered around each maze ranging from simple items like a hoverboard to more elaborate items like a robot mouse that scurries towards the exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and avoid obstacles: use your wits to solve the different puzzles and obstacles within each maze. decipher different riddles and clues to uncover secret passages, items and easter eggs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer:\u00a0compete online against your friends and players across the globe, cross-platform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade:\u00a0explore an infinite amount of cleverly generated mazes of varying forms and worlds. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Wander a world filled with cleverly-crafted mazes. Whoever can solve them all gets their wish granted by the Maze God. Explore beautiful mazes, discover unique items and help other maze explorers complete unusual side quests in the first immersive maze adventure ever!",
